WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.870
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:14.140 --> 00:15.870
Are you doing well at his house?

3
00:16.340 --> 00:17.250
Pretty good.

4
00:17.450 --> 00:18.290
That's good.

5
00:18.410 --> 00:19.130
Master.

6
00:19.720 --> 00:20.510
Don't go.

7
00:23.570 --> 00:24.660
Do you know her?

8
00:27.090 --> 00:30.020
She is Director Wang's newly wedded third concubine,

9
00:30.020 --> 00:31.340
Feiyan's sister,

10
00:31.580 --> 00:33.380
and one of Yuehaitang's people.

11
02:15.220 --> 02:18.870
[A Prophet]

12
02:19.860 --> 02:21.870
[Episode 11]

13
02:24.329 --> 02:26.020
Director, you were born into one family and raised in another.

14
02:26.020 --> 02:26.610
What do you mean?

15
02:26.610 --> 02:28.900
The ones who raised you are not your biological parents.

16
02:28.900 --> 02:29.579
Go on.

17
02:29.579 --> 02:30.530
There is a river or a pond

18
02:30.530 --> 02:32.329
south of your ancestral home.

19
02:32.329 --> 02:34.210
That's why you managed to become an official.

20
02:34.210 --> 02:35.060
Keep divining.

21
02:35.060 --> 02:38.610
If you don't tell me whether I'm right or wrong, I won't dare to say more.

22
02:38.610 --> 02:39.300
You're right.

23
02:39.300 --> 02:40.530
There was a pond.

24
02:40.530 --> 02:42.460
But it dried up during a severe drought.

25
02:42.460 --> 02:43.740
You have taken all the good feng shui.

26
02:43.740 --> 02:46.140
When you became an official, the water naturally disappeared.

27
02:46.140 --> 02:48.050
These are all verifiable.

28
02:48.050 --> 02:50.110
Tell me something others don't know.

29
02:54.579 --> 02:58.530
There's a piece of shrapnel three inches below your Dantian.

30
03:06.740 --> 03:08.300
It seems you're called the Iron Plate Fortune Teller

31
03:08.300 --> 03:10.050
for a good reason.

32
03:10.530 --> 03:12.330
I admit I still can't quite figure out

33
03:12.330 --> 03:14.530
this whole affair you mentioned.

34
03:18.700 --> 03:20.370
Let's talk in private.

35
03:24.420 --> 03:25.480
All of you, get out.

36
03:27.090 --> 03:27.820
Director...

37
03:28.140 --> 03:29.140
Get out, get out.

38
03:36.530 --> 03:37.740
You are brilliant, Master.

39
03:37.740 --> 03:38.610
We almost

40
03:38.900 --> 03:40.420
fell into Fan Jialie's trap.

41
03:40.420 --> 03:41.680
I'll deal with that guy

42
03:41.980 --> 03:43.090
sooner or later.

43
03:43.300 --> 03:44.829
He's still inexperienced.

44
03:48.810 --> 03:50.490
How are the preparations

45
03:50.490 --> 03:52.090
for the salvation ritual going?

46
03:52.090 --> 03:55.210
Shangguan Chengming is planning to gather

47
03:55.370 --> 03:57.210
the people by the river and hold

48
03:57.260 --> 03:58.700
an altar ritual on July 15th.

49
03:58.700 --> 04:00.610
Get my outfit ready.

50
04:00.610 --> 04:03.070
I'll perform the ritual when the time comes.

51
04:03.140 --> 04:04.340
Is that appropriate?

52
04:04.490 --> 04:06.460
We're in the teeth of the storm right now.

53
04:06.460 --> 04:07.740
Just let that kid do it.

54
04:08.610 --> 04:10.370
This represents the Tianxiang Sect.

55
04:10.370 --> 04:12.020
He's not qualified for it.

56
04:14.700 --> 04:17.410
Do you really plan to keep him in Tianxiang Sect?

57
04:18.290 --> 04:20.730
Don't you think this kid is quite interesting?

58
04:20.730 --> 04:21.820
He's alright.

59
04:22.290 --> 04:23.500
I just think

60
04:23.940 --> 04:26.400
he doesn't deserve you treating him so well.

61
04:26.940 --> 04:28.800
Back then, people also advised me

62
04:28.820 --> 04:30.460
not to treat you so well.

63
04:35.380 --> 04:39.340
[The show begins]

64
04:39.390 --> 04:42.700
[Linjiang Pier]

65
05:09.700 --> 05:12.580
Start the ritual.

66
05:35.580 --> 05:36.580
Why are you here?

67
05:36.620 --> 05:37.170
Liang.

68
05:37.700 --> 05:39.140
Can we skip it today?

69
05:39.580 --> 05:41.780
This mission is important. I have to go.

70
05:42.070 --> 05:43.630
I'm afraid the Plum Blossom Sect will come to cause trouble.

71
05:43.630 --> 05:45.220
If you're afraid of dying, go home and feed the pigs.

72
05:45.220 --> 05:46.540
Let go.

73
07:06.020 --> 07:06.770
Father.

74
07:07.290 --> 07:08.700
Rest in peace.

75
07:09.210 --> 07:10.650
I miss you.

76
07:10.770 --> 07:12.410
Please, gods, bless my mother

77
07:12.410 --> 07:13.540
with a full recovery

78
07:13.940 --> 07:14.900
and a long life.

79
07:14.970 --> 07:16.020
God bless.

80
07:16.020 --> 07:18.500
Let me have a child this year.

81
07:18.850 --> 07:19.700
My child.

82
07:19.770 --> 07:21.730
Be born into a good family in your next life

83
07:21.730 --> 07:22.990
so you won't go hungry.

84
07:23.140 --> 07:24.730
Peace and safety

85
07:24.730 --> 07:26.700
year after year.

86
07:28.090 --> 07:30.530
May our family be safe,

87
07:30.530 --> 07:31.850
may everything go smoothly,

88
07:31.850 --> 07:33.330
and may it all end well.

89
07:35.470 --> 07:38.790
Bless my son with good health

90
07:39.210 --> 07:40.940
and a life free of illness.

91
08:06.850 --> 08:07.730
Liang.

92
08:09.020 --> 08:09.770
Liang.

93
08:11.020 --> 08:11.970
Liang.

94
08:35.740 --> 08:36.500
Bro.

95
08:38.380 --> 08:39.260
Liang.

96
08:39.260 --> 08:39.570
Easy, easy.

97
08:39.570 --> 08:40.289
Are you okay?

98
08:40.289 --> 08:41.049
I'm fine.

99
08:41.980 --> 08:43.270
Sect Master.

100
08:43.289 --> 08:44.420
Sit down, everyone.

101
08:44.530 --> 08:45.260
Sit.

102
08:45.770 --> 08:47.450
Sect Master, why are you here?

103
08:47.530 --> 08:48.200
How are you doing?

104
08:48.200 --> 08:48.910
I'm fine.

105
08:49.170 --> 08:50.340
You expected

106
08:50.570 --> 08:51.930
something to happen tonight, didn't you?

107
08:51.930 --> 08:53.900
You crashed the Plum Blossom Sect's setup

108
08:53.900 --> 08:55.020
and offended them.

109
08:55.050 --> 08:57.140
Did you think they'd let it go?

110
08:57.410 --> 08:59.540
We should have handed you over to them.

111
08:59.770 --> 09:02.100
I will take responsibility for my own actions.

112
09:02.100 --> 09:03.900
It's not too late to hand me over now.

113
09:03.900 --> 09:06.140
This is no longer just your problem.

114
09:07.690 --> 09:08.570
We can't

115
09:09.340 --> 09:11.000
suffer this loss for nothing.

116
09:42.140 --> 09:43.340
I had a great time today.

117
09:43.340 --> 09:45.050
I'll come again next time.

118
09:58.410 --> 09:59.670
As for this Fan Jialie,

119
09:59.730 --> 10:01.100
we have already figured him out.

120
10:01.100 --> 10:01.980
This guy

121
10:02.050 --> 10:03.100
makes dirty money,

122
10:03.100 --> 10:04.170
has wide influence,

123
10:04.170 --> 10:06.050
is treacherous and cunning,

124
10:06.290 --> 10:08.410
and never leaves a trace.

125
10:08.530 --> 10:11.770
Seventh Brother and I have also uncovered some information.

126
10:11.770 --> 10:14.050
Their legitimate businesses

127
10:14.140 --> 10:16.140
are all under his biological son...

128
10:17.050 --> 10:17.930
Fan Zhehan.

129
10:17.930 --> 10:18.530
Yes.

130
10:19.100 --> 10:20.860
Under Fan Zhehan's name.

131
10:21.100 --> 10:22.220
But Fan Zhehan

132
10:22.220 --> 10:23.930
is a hopeless case.

133
10:24.410 --> 10:26.100
He spends all day womanizing.

134
10:26.620 --> 10:27.290
In short,

135
10:27.340 --> 10:29.650
the Fan family's dirty money

136
10:29.690 --> 10:32.810
all goes through the secret accounts of Shunxiang Teahouse.

137
10:32.810 --> 10:34.690
My friends at the teahouse also told me

138
10:34.690 --> 10:37.050
that Fan Jialie has an illegitimate son

139
10:37.380 --> 10:38.410
named Fan Xinze.

140
10:38.620 --> 10:40.150
He was born to a prostitute,

141
10:40.340 --> 10:41.860
so his father doesn't like him

142
10:41.860 --> 10:43.920
and made him a waiter at the teahouse.

143
10:44.170 --> 10:45.500
Fan Zhehan also bullies him often.

144
10:45.500 --> 10:47.690
This Fan Jialie is a bastard.

145
10:47.690 --> 10:48.770
His eldest son

146
10:48.810 --> 10:50.020
is also a bastard.

147
10:50.260 --> 10:53.100
Doesn't he treat his eldest son like a treasure?

148
10:53.260 --> 10:55.570
Let's cut off

149
10:55.570 --> 10:56.690
his lifeline.

150
10:57.900 --> 10:59.220
Cut off his family jewels?

151
10:59.220 --> 11:01.570
Yan can do this job just fine.

152
11:01.810 --> 11:04.170
As the saying goes, lust is a knife above the head.

153
11:04.170 --> 11:05.500
If Yan takes action,

154
11:05.500 --> 11:07.360
she can solve it with two fingers.

155
11:07.530 --> 11:09.050
You talk too much.

156
11:09.100 --> 11:09.740
Are you angry?

157
11:09.740 --> 11:11.100
Just kidding.

158
11:11.340 --> 11:14.530
Fan Jialie has harmed many people these years.

159
11:14.620 --> 11:17.620
He even dared to attack the people of the Tianxiang Sect.

160
11:17.620 --> 11:18.260
Now,

161
11:18.500 --> 11:21.620
it's not just for the members of the Tianxiang Sect,

162
11:21.770 --> 11:24.690
but also for the people of Yucheng.

163
11:25.050 --> 11:25.770
So,

164
11:26.770 --> 11:28.900
we must deal with him.

165
11:29.410 --> 11:30.260
Feiyan.

166
11:31.170 --> 11:31.620
Master.

167
11:31.620 --> 11:33.450
Since it's what everyone hopes,

168
11:34.050 --> 11:35.170
then Fan Zhehan...

169
11:35.380 --> 11:36.410
is in your hands.

170
11:37.690 --> 11:38.690
Please.

171
11:38.900 --> 11:40.100
Don't worry, Master.

172
11:41.070 --> 11:42.020
Let's toast to the Fifth Batou.

173
11:42.020 --> 11:43.260
Cheers.

174
11:43.340 --> 11:44.600
To a successful start.

175
11:45.900 --> 11:46.900
Let's eat.

176
11:55.900 --> 11:56.780
Liu.

177
11:57.570 --> 11:59.450
Meatballs.

178
12:21.560 --> 12:22.800
Happy birthday.

179
12:25.340 --> 12:27.410
This is the first time someone

180
12:27.560 --> 12:29.550
has prepared longevity noodles for me.

181
12:29.550 --> 12:30.470
Thank you.

182
12:32.570 --> 12:33.740
Happy birthday.

183
12:35.220 --> 12:37.340
Everything said during the setup was fake.

184
12:37.340 --> 12:38.170
Forget it.

185
12:39.570 --> 12:40.530
Actually,

186
12:41.260 --> 12:41.860
I don't even know

187
12:41.860 --> 12:43.260
when my birthday is.

188
12:45.740 --> 12:47.070
Dealing with Fan Jialie

189
12:47.380 --> 12:49.240
must be very troublesome, right?

190
12:50.450 --> 12:51.410
I can help you.

191
12:51.980 --> 12:52.810
I have a plan...

192
12:52.810 --> 12:54.810
Didn't you say today is my birthday?

193
12:55.100 --> 12:56.050
Then why don't

194
12:56.770 --> 12:58.170
I make a wish?

195
12:59.690 --> 13:00.900
I hope that

196
13:01.900 --> 13:05.430
you will not participate in any of the Tianxiang Sect's schemes

197
13:05.980 --> 13:07.290
in the future.

198
13:30.410 --> 13:31.290
Young Master Fan, you're here.

199
13:31.290 --> 13:32.500
Please come in.

200
13:33.220 --> 13:34.380
Young Master Fan.

201
13:35.290 --> 13:38.380
Miss Xiaoyun has gotten prettier.

202
13:38.690 --> 13:40.050
Come on.

203
13:40.930 --> 13:44.570
Young Master Fan, why are you so late today?

204
13:45.140 --> 13:47.530
The girls are all waiting for you.

205
13:54.020 --> 13:55.260
Madam Sang.

206
13:55.380 --> 13:57.740
I heard you have a new

207
13:57.900 --> 14:00.030
female Fortune-teller from Pujiang.

208
14:01.170 --> 14:02.740
Indeed.

209
14:03.020 --> 14:04.770
Mr. Fan, you really are

210
14:04.810 --> 14:06.500
well-informed.

211
14:07.900 --> 14:09.650
Our Miss Wantang

212
14:09.690 --> 14:11.410
is making her debut here

213
14:11.410 --> 14:13.140
tonight.

214
14:13.620 --> 14:14.620
Young Master Fan.

215
14:14.980 --> 14:16.930
Do you also want to join the tea gathering?

216
14:16.930 --> 14:18.170
Exactly.

217
14:18.570 --> 14:21.690
I'm booking Miss Wantang for tonight.

218
14:21.740 --> 14:24.930
I want to invite her to see the night view of Yucheng.

219
14:26.410 --> 14:28.670
You think you can just book her like that?

220
14:34.020 --> 14:36.570
Do you know what first come, first served means?

221
14:36.570 --> 14:39.450
Where did this little punk come from?

222
14:39.530 --> 14:42.020
How dare you challenge me in Yucheng?

223
14:42.740 --> 14:43.870
I offer one hundred.

224
14:45.100 --> 14:47.140
You reek of poverty.

225
14:47.140 --> 14:48.170
Get out of the way.

226
14:50.140 --> 14:51.530
Young Master Fan.

227
14:51.690 --> 14:53.220
Miss Wantang

228
14:53.290 --> 14:56.260
is already friends with this gentleman.

229
14:56.980 --> 14:59.170
This has nothing to do with money.

230
14:59.530 --> 15:00.260
Nothing.

231
15:00.290 --> 15:02.570
Friendship is priceless.

232
15:02.690 --> 15:03.740
I get it.

233
15:04.170 --> 15:05.930
You want more money.

234
15:06.900 --> 15:07.980
Madam Sang.

235
15:08.450 --> 15:11.100
I wonder if this gold bar

236
15:13.020 --> 15:14.380
is enough?

237
15:17.220 --> 15:18.570
Is that all you've got?

238
15:23.220 --> 15:25.260
I offer 3 gold bars.

239
15:27.930 --> 15:30.450
Where did this guy come from?

240
15:31.450 --> 15:33.290
Do you know who I am?

241
15:33.410 --> 15:35.050
I really don't know.

242
15:35.770 --> 15:36.900
Why don't

243
15:38.170 --> 15:39.410
you tell me in detail?

244
15:43.450 --> 15:44.250
Young Master.

245
15:44.340 --> 15:45.140
Young Master,

246
15:45.140 --> 15:46.260
don't stoop to his level.

247
15:46.260 --> 15:47.140
Master already dislikes you

248
15:47.140 --> 15:48.180
coming to such places.

249
15:48.180 --> 15:49.910
You talk too much.

250
15:50.020 --> 15:50.740
Get lost.

251
15:55.770 --> 15:56.980
Just you wait.

252
16:02.810 --> 16:03.650
Yinlian!

253
16:04.930 --> 16:05.930
Where is Yinlian?

254
16:08.290 --> 16:10.670
Congratulations, young master.

255
16:10.690 --> 16:12.950
Congratulations on winning the beauty.

256
16:13.340 --> 16:14.940
I'll prepare things for you.

257
16:30.900 --> 16:32.260
Why did you buy this?

258
16:32.530 --> 16:34.140
It's too expensive.

259
16:34.860 --> 16:37.900
Aren't you saving money to buy my freedom?

260
16:37.930 --> 16:39.100
Don't worry, Yinlian.

261
16:39.100 --> 16:41.030
I've already talked to Madam Sang.

262
16:41.050 --> 16:42.710
This little bit won't matter.

263
16:42.930 --> 16:44.260
Once I've saved up enough money,

264
16:44.260 --> 16:45.590
I'll get you out of here.

265
16:46.220 --> 16:47.690
Then we can be together.

266
16:51.460 --> 16:52.050
Young Master.

267
16:52.050 --> 16:53.770
There's a guest inside.

268
16:53.810 --> 16:54.900
I'm pissed off today

269
16:54.900 --> 16:55.810
because of you.

270
16:55.980 --> 16:56.910
Get out of my way.

271
17:01.220 --> 17:03.500
I was wondering which VIP was here.

272
17:03.970 --> 17:05.450
So it's you sneaking around here.

273
17:05.450 --> 17:06.450
Young Master Fan,

274
17:07.170 --> 17:08.700
what brings you here today?

275
17:08.780 --> 17:10.819
Madam Sang, what's with the arrangement?

276
17:10.819 --> 17:12.540
A guest like Young Master Fan

277
17:12.579 --> 17:14.210
should be in the VIP room.

278
17:14.250 --> 17:14.780
Young Master Fan.

279
17:14.780 --> 17:15.710
Get out of my way.

280
17:15.930 --> 17:16.490
I wanted

281
17:16.730 --> 17:17.930
to come here.

282
17:21.140 --> 17:21.970
Yinlian.

283
17:23.300 --> 17:24.300
Did you miss me?

284
17:24.380 --> 17:25.380
Young Master Fan.

285
17:25.390 --> 17:26.910
When you're out,

286
17:26.930 --> 17:29.930
you should follow the rule of first come, first served.

287
17:29.930 --> 17:30.780
Rules?

288
17:31.410 --> 17:33.540
You're talking to me about rules?

289
17:33.970 --> 17:34.690
Fine.

290
17:35.170 --> 17:36.210
Then today,

291
17:36.340 --> 17:38.060
I'll teach you about rules.

292
17:41.010 --> 17:42.970
There is a difference between the legitimate and the illegitimate.

293
17:42.970 --> 17:43.900
Moreover,

294
17:45.540 --> 17:47.940
you're not even considered illegitimate.

295
17:48.140 --> 17:51.100
Back then, to gamble on that hand of cards,

296
17:51.250 --> 17:53.210
you lost everything

297
17:53.580 --> 17:55.930
and lived off women.

298
17:56.540 --> 17:57.340
What?

299
17:57.690 --> 18:01.170
Now you're playing the romantic here?

300
18:03.170 --> 18:04.300
No wonder

301
18:04.410 --> 18:06.860
you get so excited when you see a whore.

302
18:09.410 --> 18:10.450
I forgot.

303
18:12.730 --> 18:13.930
Your mother

304
18:14.730 --> 18:16.930
came from here, didn't she?

305
18:28.780 --> 18:30.100
Look, we're brothers.

306
18:30.410 --> 18:33.140
How can we get mad over a whore?

307
18:33.250 --> 18:33.860
Right?

308
18:34.490 --> 18:35.540
Come, come.

309
18:35.690 --> 18:36.540
You...

310
18:37.860 --> 18:38.860
Can just sit here.

311
18:40.250 --> 18:41.100
And you...

312
18:41.730 --> 18:42.780
Come with me.

313
18:47.340 --> 18:49.170
Young Master!

314
18:51.100 --> 18:53.210
You get called Mr. Fan once,

315
18:53.930 --> 18:56.650
and you think you're part of the Fan family?

316
18:58.270 --> 18:59.880
You son of a whore.

317
18:59.900 --> 19:01.010
In this lifetime,

318
19:01.170 --> 19:04.570
don't ever think about entering the Fan family's genealogy.

319
19:04.780 --> 19:06.860
You're just like your whore mother,

320
19:07.100 --> 19:09.490
only fit to beg for mercy

321
19:09.490 --> 19:11.540
and live like a dog.

322
19:19.900 --> 19:22.100
I told you not to come, but you insisted.

323
19:22.380 --> 19:24.410
I'm not here for pleasure.

324
19:25.210 --> 19:26.580
I'm here on business.

325
19:27.900 --> 19:29.170
Give me some water.

326
19:30.380 --> 19:31.450
The drinks here

327
19:32.210 --> 19:33.870
are for entertaining guests.

328
19:36.900 --> 19:37.360
This...

329
19:37.820 --> 19:38.730
You can't drink this.

330
19:38.730 --> 19:40.210
If there's poison in this wine,

331
19:40.210 --> 19:41.410
I can smell it.

332
19:44.970 --> 19:45.650
Good wine.

333
19:46.210 --> 19:47.610
Very thirst-quenching.

334
19:49.930 --> 19:51.660
You can detect poison by scent.

335
19:52.140 --> 19:53.650
But what if there's

336
19:54.450 --> 19:56.050
something else in this wine?

337
19:56.780 --> 19:57.730
For example,

338
19:58.690 --> 19:59.620
an aphrodisiac?

339
20:07.560 --> 20:08.560
Really?

340
20:10.210 --> 20:11.340
I wonder.

341
20:11.930 --> 20:13.140
You'll know soon enough.

342
20:13.140 --> 20:13.820
Wait.

343
20:14.060 --> 20:16.260
Weren't you going to drug that Fan brat?

344
20:16.500 --> 20:17.900
What kind of move is this?

345
20:18.140 --> 20:19.820
I wanted to make him anxious.

346
20:20.820 --> 20:21.750
Make him want it,

347
20:22.120 --> 20:23.850
but unable to have it.

348
20:44.410 --> 20:45.250
Water.

349
20:46.170 --> 20:47.250
Give me water.

350
22:31.970 --> 22:34.430
The one who saved me at Nanxi River back then,

351
22:35.300 --> 22:36.410
was it you?

352
22:43.730 --> 22:44.820
Master Du.

353
22:45.140 --> 22:47.380
Why are you here in the middle of the night?

354
22:47.380 --> 22:48.780
Where are those two kids?

355
22:49.730 --> 22:51.130
That's not for you to ask.

356
22:51.170 --> 22:53.030
Before I entered the Wang family,

357
22:53.380 --> 22:54.380
you told me

358
22:54.580 --> 22:55.970
I could leave after getting the money.

359
22:55.970 --> 22:57.650
Now you want to kill someone?

360
22:59.060 --> 23:01.140
Why do you never learn your lesson?

361
23:01.620 --> 23:02.970
I warned you.

362
23:03.170 --> 23:05.540
In the setup, you are no longer yourself.

363
23:06.100 --> 23:08.700
Don't get emotionally involved with the mark.

364
23:08.780 --> 23:09.620
Master Du.

365
23:10.730 --> 23:12.330
Please let those two kids go.

366
23:12.650 --> 23:13.340
Can you?

367
23:15.140 --> 23:16.730
After acting for a few days,

368
23:16.900 --> 23:20.030
do you really think you're a chaste and righteous woman?

369
23:20.500 --> 23:21.650
Have you forgotten the rules?

370
23:21.650 --> 23:23.910
But the Sect Master's rule is no killing.

371
23:25.790 --> 23:27.900
I didn't hear what you just said.

372
23:28.450 --> 23:30.650
The Sect Master's rule is no killing...

373
23:31.580 --> 23:33.180
You've learned to talk back.

374
23:33.300 --> 23:34.930
Don't think just because the Sect Master values you,

375
23:34.930 --> 23:36.820
you can be disrespectful to me.

376
23:37.130 --> 23:39.130
You little bitches from Yuehaitang

377
23:39.250 --> 23:40.690
are just objects in our hands

378
23:40.690 --> 23:42.860
to be ordered around.

379
23:43.100 --> 23:45.210
Do objects have the right to speak?

380
24:12.820 --> 24:14.300
Was it you?

381
24:15.490 --> 24:16.410
Yes.

382
24:17.340 --> 24:18.490
You saved me.

383
24:19.650 --> 24:21.850
Aren't you afraid of ruining the setup?

384
24:27.380 --> 24:28.510
I already saved you.

385
24:29.590 --> 24:31.190
What is there to be afraid of?

386
24:32.620 --> 24:33.690
Tell me.

387
24:34.580 --> 24:36.240
What exactly do you want to do?

388
24:36.900 --> 24:38.450
Leave Fan Zhehan alone.

389
24:40.690 --> 24:42.820
I'll deal with that illegitimate son.

390
24:42.970 --> 24:44.620
A legitimate son is a treasure.

391
24:44.620 --> 24:46.380
An illegitimate son is just a weed.

392
24:46.380 --> 24:47.510
I want the treasure,

393
24:47.780 --> 24:48.490
not the weed.

394
24:48.490 --> 24:50.690
Even though this weed seems worthless,

395
24:51.900 --> 24:53.100
in this setup,

396
24:55.450 --> 24:56.730
he is a treasure.

397
24:58.820 --> 25:01.360
[Wanli Gambling House]

398
25:01.510 --> 25:02.700
Have fun, boss.

399
25:17.340 --> 25:18.410
I'm done playing. I lose every day.

400
25:18.410 --> 25:19.670
I'm never coming back.

401
25:30.040 --> 25:30.730
Deal again.

402
25:35.010 --> 25:36.660
I don't know whose bad luck rubbed off on me.

403
25:36.660 --> 25:38.120
I haven't won a single hand all night.

404
25:38.120 --> 25:39.010
I'm so mad.

405
25:39.100 --> 25:39.580
Come on.

406
25:43.060 --> 25:43.620
Wait.

407
25:45.650 --> 25:46.380
Let me do it.

408
25:52.620 --> 25:53.270
Seven.

409
26:04.580 --> 26:06.110
Heaven, Earth, Tiger Head.

410
26:06.990 --> 26:07.430
So big.

411
26:07.450 --> 26:08.650
Three and six make a goose.

412
26:08.650 --> 26:10.340
Top and bottom lose; Heaven wins.

413
26:10.340 --> 26:12.200
Are you going to jinx me all night?

414
26:12.690 --> 26:13.250
Brother.

415
26:13.250 --> 26:13.860
What?

416
26:13.970 --> 26:14.780
Do me a favor.

417
26:14.860 --> 26:15.970
Sit here and don't move.

418
26:15.970 --> 26:17.300
Don't ruin my feng shui.

419
26:17.730 --> 26:18.930
I'll give you half

420
26:19.340 --> 26:20.870
of all my winnings tonight.

421
26:23.860 --> 26:24.820
Let's continue.

422
26:27.140 --> 26:28.470
Bets placed, hands off.

423
26:29.010 --> 26:30.060
For me?

424
26:37.990 --> 26:39.580
Come on, blow on it.

425
26:40.690 --> 26:41.650
Blow what?

426
26:42.060 --> 26:44.060
Blow some of your magic breath on it.

427
26:44.830 --> 26:46.070
You're crazy.

428
26:50.450 --> 26:51.100
What?

429
26:51.340 --> 26:52.300
A nine-harmony win?

430
26:52.300 --> 26:53.410
Such a big hand.

431
26:53.580 --> 26:54.780
How is that possible?

432
26:58.250 --> 26:59.170
Really?

433
27:00.750 --> 27:01.550
Pay up.

434
27:28.170 --> 27:29.060
Brother.

435
27:29.900 --> 27:32.410
Tonight, we are the kings of the room.

436
27:33.060 --> 27:35.920
I'm going to establish my dominance with this hand.

437
27:36.340 --> 27:37.870
Just tell me, for this hand,

438
27:38.710 --> 27:40.310
do we go all out?

439
27:42.970 --> 27:47.410
All out!

440
27:47.860 --> 27:51.080
[Chunfeng House]

441
27:49.330 --> 27:52.130
Sect Master wants to know how your plan is going.

442
27:53.900 --> 27:55.060
I heard

443
27:55.580 --> 27:56.780
Shangguan Chengming

444
27:57.410 --> 27:58.730
meddled in this.

445
28:00.780 --> 28:02.240
There was a slight hiccup,

446
28:02.930 --> 28:04.300
but no harm was done.

447
28:04.820 --> 28:06.350
The mark has taken the bait.

448
28:13.820 --> 28:14.480
Sect Master

449
28:14.860 --> 28:15.860
is kind-hearted.

450
28:17.690 --> 28:19.820
But you need to see things clearly.

451
28:20.060 --> 28:21.410
Shangguan Chengming

452
28:22.010 --> 28:23.210
has wild ambitions.

453
28:24.900 --> 28:26.830
Be careful not to get bitten by him.

454
28:27.950 --> 28:29.480
Have some tea before you go.

455
28:47.360 --> 28:48.420
Get out of here right now!

456
28:48.420 --> 28:49.750
Get out!

457
28:51.230 --> 28:52.510
I can walk by myself.

458
29:01.620 --> 29:02.540
Bro.

459
29:04.300 --> 29:06.620
My name is Fan Xinze.

460
29:12.410 --> 29:13.930
What's your name?

461
29:14.970 --> 29:15.780
Me?

462
29:16.210 --> 29:18.010
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

463
29:19.730 --> 29:20.860
I'm sorry

464
29:21.820 --> 29:23.540
for losing all your capital.

465
29:24.820 --> 29:25.630
No worries.

466
29:27.820 --> 29:29.410
Just come with me to a place.

467
29:29.670 --> 29:31.320
Once I get my capital back,

468
29:32.140 --> 29:33.100
we'll continue.

469
29:44.620 --> 29:45.340
We're here.

470
29:46.340 --> 29:47.200
Mr. Shangguan.

471
29:47.720 --> 29:48.650
You came here...

472
29:50.490 --> 29:51.220
To get money?

473
29:52.140 --> 29:52.900
Fan.

474
29:53.620 --> 29:55.140
Wait for me here for one night.

475
29:55.140 --> 29:56.200
Tomorrow morning,

476
29:56.380 --> 29:58.180
I will definitely get the money.

477
30:03.010 --> 30:03.930
Mr. Jing?

478
30:06.690 --> 30:07.600
Mr. Shangguan.

479
30:08.210 --> 30:09.410
What happened to you?

480
30:11.840 --> 30:12.520
I'm fine.

481
30:12.620 --> 30:14.010
Let me go back and rest for two days.

482
30:14.010 --> 30:15.930
I'll fight with you again when I return.

483
30:15.930 --> 30:16.660
Definitely.

484
30:16.780 --> 30:17.650
For sure.

485
30:17.830 --> 30:19.270
Can you handle it?

486
30:22.630 --> 30:24.110
Even if it costs my life,

487
30:24.860 --> 30:26.210
I must stand with Fan

488
30:26.860 --> 30:28.060
to make a comeback.

489
30:29.250 --> 30:29.820
Okay.

490
30:30.070 --> 30:31.410
Take care. I'll get going.

491
30:31.410 --> 30:32.100
Alright.

492
30:32.390 --> 30:32.970
Get some good rest.

493
30:32.970 --> 30:33.580
See you.

494
30:33.580 --> 30:34.170
See you.

495
31:16.300 --> 31:18.250
Mr. Shangguan, what did you do?

496
31:18.650 --> 31:19.860
Are you okay?

497
31:29.060 --> 31:30.610
Let's keep going.

498
31:35.250 --> 31:42.210
Win! Win!

499
31:42.210 --> 31:44.670
I think it will definitely be fine this time.

500
32:30.160 --> 32:31.620
Mr. Shangguan, you should nourish yourself.

501
32:31.620 --> 32:32.650
Eat more and make yourself at home.

502
32:32.650 --> 32:33.780
Don't hold back.

503
32:33.970 --> 32:36.730
Fan, you run a teahouse business?

504
32:37.820 --> 32:39.880
I'm watching this place for someone.

505
32:40.450 --> 32:41.210
I heard

506
32:42.010 --> 32:44.640
the owner of this teahouse is Director Fan.

507
32:47.270 --> 32:48.270
That's my father.

508
32:51.010 --> 32:51.780
Fan,

509
32:52.580 --> 32:54.240
so you are from the Fan family.

510
32:54.780 --> 32:57.710
I've even met your brother, Eldest Young Master Fan.

511
33:00.330 --> 33:01.460
He's not my brother.

512
33:07.650 --> 33:08.450
I understand.

513
33:09.580 --> 33:11.510
Every family has its own problems.

514
33:11.970 --> 33:12.620
Here.

515
33:16.690 --> 33:17.380
Young Master.

516
33:17.380 --> 33:20.210
Here is the chicken soup you asked me to simmer.

517
33:20.540 --> 33:22.010
Go do your work. I'll serve this myself.

518
33:22.010 --> 33:24.060
You're too kind. There's too much food to finish.

519
33:24.060 --> 33:25.930
I prepared this especially for you while you were resting.

520
33:25.930 --> 33:26.540
Thank you.

521
33:26.540 --> 33:27.400
Thank you, Fan.

522
33:33.010 --> 33:34.010
It smells so good.

523
33:34.730 --> 33:35.730
Mr. Shangguan.

524
33:35.970 --> 33:38.140
You made so much money overnight.

525
33:39.660 --> 33:40.750
How did you do it?

526
33:49.280 --> 33:50.680
I mean no offense.

527
33:51.820 --> 33:53.340
I just also want to earn more

528
33:53.340 --> 33:55.380
and continue winning with you.

529
33:59.300 --> 34:01.900
We already treat each other like bros.

530
34:03.210 --> 34:04.930
As for this matter...

531
34:05.930 --> 34:07.130
Well, this matter...

532
34:10.409 --> 34:12.699
It's mainly bad for your health.

533
34:15.340 --> 34:16.570
This matter

534
34:17.409 --> 34:19.010
is related to health?

535
34:31.860 --> 34:32.929
What do you mean?

536
34:34.260 --> 34:36.179
You could say it is,

537
34:36.449 --> 34:38.179
but you could also say it isn't.

538
34:38.449 --> 34:40.699
My current blessings are all thanks to

539
34:41.030 --> 34:42.230
my past-life wealth.

540
34:42.350 --> 34:43.760
Past-life wealth?

541
34:44.780 --> 34:46.580
The so-called past-life wealth

542
34:46.780 --> 34:47.909
is the wealth accumulated by each family

543
34:47.909 --> 34:50.510
over countless past lives.

544
34:50.739 --> 34:52.020
The people of this family

545
34:52.020 --> 34:53.409
must constantly accumulate virtue and do good deeds

546
34:53.409 --> 34:54.300
to withdraw it.

547
34:54.380 --> 34:56.199
Half a year ago, at Yunhe Temple,

548
34:56.219 --> 34:57.880
I met an otherworldly master.

549
34:57.930 --> 35:00.010
He was the one who helped me withdraw it.

550
35:00.010 --> 35:02.940
However, karma and reincarnation are predestined.

551
35:03.010 --> 35:05.010
The more past-life wealth you withdraw,

552
35:05.010 --> 35:07.260
the more disasters you will face in this life.

553
35:07.260 --> 35:08.180
Mr. Shangguan,

554
35:08.610 --> 35:10.670
what you're saying is so mysterious.

555
35:10.820 --> 35:12.820
You're not making fun of me, are you?

556
35:13.570 --> 35:14.490
Disasters?

557
35:15.260 --> 35:16.740
What kind of disasters?

558
35:22.530 --> 35:24.090
Master Mei told me

559
35:24.380 --> 35:26.930
that the female Fortune-teller from Pujiang

560
35:28.700 --> 35:30.340
is probably a fraud.

561
35:30.700 --> 35:31.560
A female fraud?

562
35:33.180 --> 35:34.710
What can she cheat me out of?

563
35:35.490 --> 35:36.740
My body?

564
35:36.860 --> 35:39.530
If you and that girl don't get intimate,

565
35:39.740 --> 35:41.260
it's fine.

566
35:41.590 --> 35:43.260
But if you have any improper thoughts,

567
35:43.260 --> 35:44.180
that girl

568
35:44.260 --> 35:47.490
will definitely say she is cursed by a demon.

569
35:48.010 --> 35:50.570
If you sleep with her, Young Master Fan,

570
35:50.900 --> 35:54.180
they will say you are cursed by a demon.

571
35:55.780 --> 35:57.710
Master Mei, you're exaggerating.

572
35:57.930 --> 35:59.700
She's just a woman.

573
35:59.730 --> 36:02.690
If she can really play so many tricks,

574
36:02.710 --> 36:06.110
I ought to see her myself.

575
36:08.430 --> 36:11.500
[Chunfeng House]

576
36:14.340 --> 36:15.820
Be careful, Young Master.

577
36:16.450 --> 36:17.660
This floor

578
36:18.220 --> 36:19.900
only trips reckless people.

579
36:22.930 --> 36:24.130
Miss Wantang,

580
36:24.130 --> 36:26.490
you put this incense burner right in the doorway.

581
36:26.490 --> 36:28.090
Does this mean I'm not welcome?

582
36:28.090 --> 36:29.340
How could that be?

583
36:29.860 --> 36:31.570
Don't just stand there, Young Master.

584
36:31.570 --> 36:32.650
Come and sit.

585
36:33.090 --> 36:34.090
Have a cup of tea

586
36:34.780 --> 36:35.910
to calm your nerves.

587
36:39.040 --> 36:41.320
Miss Wantang, you're not trying to say

588
36:41.490 --> 36:43.490
that we're only having tea

589
36:43.970 --> 36:45.860
and that I can't get close to you, are you?

590
36:45.860 --> 36:47.300
You are an honored guest

591
36:47.380 --> 36:48.910
from a prestigious family.

592
36:49.090 --> 36:51.150
I will naturally entertain you well.

593
36:51.410 --> 36:52.610
It's just that...

594
36:53.820 --> 36:54.740
You wouldn't make things

595
36:54.740 --> 36:56.470
too difficult or me, would you?

596
36:56.570 --> 36:59.010
I've already paid double.

597
36:59.130 --> 37:01.050
If you think it's not enough,

598
37:01.180 --> 37:02.780
I can add more.

599
37:03.300 --> 37:04.260
Young Master.

600
37:04.530 --> 37:06.530
You've already given enough money.

601
37:06.930 --> 37:08.130
It's just that...

602
37:08.130 --> 37:10.990
Miss Wantang, you're not trying to say

603
37:11.010 --> 37:12.300
that you're cursed by a demon,

604
37:12.300 --> 37:13.700
and if I get close,

605
37:13.780 --> 37:16.040
something bad will happen to me, are you?

606
37:19.180 --> 37:21.700
Actually, I don't believe in those things either.

607
37:21.700 --> 37:23.180
I did indeed use

608
37:23.260 --> 37:25.010
the tea-session-only excuse

609
37:25.380 --> 37:27.660
to avoid many stinky men I look down on.

610
37:28.090 --> 37:29.090
However,

611
37:31.220 --> 37:33.820
meeting a noble person like Mr. Fan tonight,

612
37:35.130 --> 37:36.100
I am

613
37:37.300 --> 37:38.960
willing to make an exception.

614
37:40.530 --> 37:41.610
Then...

615
37:43.070 --> 37:44.070
Young Master.

616
37:44.300 --> 37:45.740
Don't be so impatient.

617
37:45.970 --> 37:48.530
Please sit here and rest for a while.

618
37:49.090 --> 37:50.260
I still

619
37:50.780 --> 37:52.580
need to make some preparations.

620
37:53.450 --> 37:54.850
Then go prepare quickly.

621
38:10.340 --> 38:11.410
Miss Wantang,

622
38:12.340 --> 38:15.570
what new trick from Pujiang is this?

623
38:15.700 --> 38:17.180
You don't understand.

624
38:17.180 --> 38:18.570
I'm doing all this

625
38:18.660 --> 38:20.780
for your sake.

626
38:20.780 --> 38:22.260
For my sake?

627
38:22.740 --> 38:25.380
Then hurry over here

628
38:26.010 --> 38:27.570
and let me admire you.

629
38:29.090 --> 38:30.410
Mr. Fan.

630
38:31.220 --> 38:32.530
No need to rush.

631
38:32.970 --> 38:34.380
Look at all that sweat.

632
38:34.900 --> 38:36.310
Let me wipe it for you.

633
38:44.180 --> 38:45.580
Are you alright, Mr. Fan?

634
38:45.930 --> 38:46.970
I'm fine.

635
38:50.220 --> 38:51.090
Young Master.

636
38:51.490 --> 38:53.090
Actually, I'm doing all this

637
38:53.130 --> 38:54.930
because I'm afraid something might happen to you.

638
38:54.930 --> 38:57.130
I don't want to get into a lawsuit later.

639
38:57.380 --> 38:59.310
I can't bear that responsibility.

640
38:59.740 --> 39:01.010
What lawsuit?

641
39:01.180 --> 39:02.740
You don't know, Mr. Fan.

642
39:03.340 --> 39:05.200
Years ago, an old Fortune-teller

643
39:05.340 --> 39:07.140
said I was under a demonic spell.

644
39:07.300 --> 39:08.260
He also said that

645
39:08.900 --> 39:10.450
anyone who slept with me

646
39:10.900 --> 39:12.490
would die suddenly.

647
39:13.130 --> 39:16.010
Who would believe that?

648
39:17.050 --> 39:19.090
At first, I didn't believe it either.

649
39:19.090 --> 39:20.820
But who could have thought that

650
39:21.220 --> 39:22.820
on the day of my wedding

651
39:23.410 --> 39:24.780
with my husband,

652
39:25.660 --> 39:26.300
he...

653
39:27.030 --> 39:28.890
What happened on the wedding day?

654
39:29.820 --> 39:31.300
He was really killed by me.

655
39:31.340 --> 39:33.050
He died, not me.

656
39:34.050 --> 39:34.860
He died,

657
39:35.260 --> 39:36.380
so aren't you mine now?

658
39:36.380 --> 39:36.900
Mr. Fan,

659
39:36.900 --> 39:38.570
why won't you listen to anything I say?

660
39:38.570 --> 39:39.970
What if something happens to you?

661
39:39.970 --> 39:40.660
Stop struggling.

662
39:40.660 --> 39:42.300
Tonight, you are mine.

663
39:43.220 --> 39:44.010
Mr. Fan,

664
39:44.820 --> 39:45.620
wait a moment.

665
39:46.490 --> 39:47.260
Oh my god!

666
39:47.780 --> 39:48.580
What's wrong?

667
39:49.220 --> 39:50.180
Get up.

668
39:51.380 --> 39:52.130
Mr. Fan.

669
39:52.340 --> 39:54.050
Why am I suddenly so itchy?

670
39:54.220 --> 39:55.050
Why do you have so many

671
39:55.050 --> 39:56.530
red rashes on your chest?

672
39:57.820 --> 39:58.820
This is exactly the same

673
39:58.820 --> 40:00.600
as the red rashes my husband had back then.

674
40:00.600 --> 40:01.440
This...

675
40:03.050 --> 40:04.970
Why are there suddenly so many red rashes?

676
40:04.970 --> 40:05.860
Mr. Fan,

677
40:06.220 --> 40:07.340
why don't you let me

678
40:08.340 --> 40:09.400
take a look for you?

679
40:09.530 --> 40:10.740
Don't.

680
40:10.970 --> 40:12.010
Just stay here.

681
40:16.260 --> 40:17.260
Why is it so itchy?

682
40:17.860 --> 40:19.220
This is really bizarre.

683
40:19.450 --> 40:20.380
Mr. Fan,

684
40:20.780 --> 40:22.220
let me take a look for you.

685
40:22.220 --> 40:22.900
No.

686
40:22.900 --> 40:23.530
Stop.

687
40:23.970 --> 40:24.970
Just stand there.

688
40:25.090 --> 40:26.020
Don't come over.

689
40:26.410 --> 40:27.860
It seems that

690
40:28.320 --> 40:29.470
you dislike me now.

691
40:29.490 --> 40:30.740
I don't dislike you.

692
40:30.740 --> 40:32.540
I just don't like feeling itchy.

693
40:33.900 --> 40:34.530
Today...

694
40:34.740 --> 40:35.940
That's all for today.

695
40:36.220 --> 40:36.930
Mr. Fan,

696
40:37.660 --> 40:39.040
if you leave now,

697
40:39.180 --> 40:41.450
the money won't be refunded.

698
40:41.570 --> 40:42.780
Keep the money here.

699
40:43.010 --> 40:44.410
I'll come back next time.

700
40:48.310 --> 40:49.180
The chief ordered

701
40:49.180 --> 40:51.440
to take this woman back to the residence.

702
40:56.740 --> 40:57.940
Infinite blessings.

703
40:58.050 --> 40:59.820
Master, we're here.

704
41:07.220 --> 41:07.860
Master.

705
41:14.660 --> 41:15.410
Master.

706
41:18.090 --> 41:20.180
People fear accidents,

707
41:20.180 --> 41:22.530
and incense fears different lengths.

708
41:22.590 --> 41:24.190
This saying is indeed true.

709
41:25.490 --> 41:26.610
What a pity.

710
41:27.540 --> 41:28.710
What do you mean?

711
41:29.220 --> 41:30.860
I just cast a hexagram.

712
41:31.090 --> 41:32.410
The hexagram says

713
41:35.180 --> 41:36.410
Mr. Jing is gone.

714
41:36.860 --> 41:38.130
The Mr. Jing I know?

715
41:39.180 --> 41:40.640
He passed away last night.

716
41:40.740 --> 41:41.820
Mr. Jing?

717
41:42.740 --> 41:43.780
Mr. Shangguan.

718
41:43.860 --> 41:44.460
Rest well.

719
41:44.460 --> 41:44.930
See you.

720
41:44.930 --> 41:45.450
See you.

721
41:47.950 --> 41:50.240
The guy from yesterday?

722
41:53.660 --> 41:55.700
If I remember correctly,

723
41:55.820 --> 41:57.970
you were brought here by Mr. Jing.

724
41:58.300 --> 41:58.970
Yes.

725
41:59.490 --> 42:00.750
Your friend, Mr. Jing,

726
42:00.900 --> 42:03.130
withdrew too much past-life wealth.

727
42:03.180 --> 42:04.710
The backlash was too heavy,

728
42:04.780 --> 42:06.530
and he couldn't survive it.

729
42:06.660 --> 42:08.490
Today is not a good time either.

730
42:08.610 --> 42:10.780
I have to perform a ritual to send the money back.

731
42:10.780 --> 42:12.440
Please come back another day.

732
42:16.270 --> 42:17.060
Fan,

733
42:17.490 --> 42:19.370
the Master is not available today.

734
42:19.370 --> 42:20.970
Let's come back another day.

735
42:32.370 --> 42:33.260
Mr. Shangguan.

736
42:43.950 --> 42:45.030
Mr. Shangguan.

737
42:46.410 --> 42:48.380
Are we just leaving like this?

738
42:50.450 --> 42:52.100
I haven't got the money yet.

739
42:55.300 --> 42:56.820
When I first met Mr. Jing,

740
42:58.300 --> 43:00.490
he was still a burly man.

741
43:01.490 --> 43:03.300
Since he took his past-life wealth,

742
43:03.300 --> 43:04.660
although he became rich overnight,

743
43:04.660 --> 43:05.970
his body

744
43:06.220 --> 43:08.090
suddenly became as thin as a rake,

745
43:08.300 --> 43:09.700
and his face became haggard.

746
43:09.700 --> 43:10.860
His outcome

747
43:11.340 --> 43:12.940
truly proves the saying that

748
43:13.220 --> 43:15.260
greed knows no bounds.

749
43:15.700 --> 43:18.090
What about the money in the alchemy furnace?

750
43:18.090 --> 43:20.220
The master will naturally put it back.

751
43:20.780 --> 43:21.780
Mr. Jing,

752
43:21.920 --> 43:23.980
you can still use it in your next life.

753
43:31.820 --> 43:32.650
Fan.

754
43:34.660 --> 43:36.380
I think we should just forget it.

755
43:36.380 --> 43:37.570
With your body,

756
43:37.970 --> 43:39.700
I'm afraid you can't handle it.

757
43:40.010 --> 43:41.340
I'll just take a little.

758
43:42.300 --> 43:43.500
I have an urgent need.

759
43:45.790 --> 43:47.790
Are you in some kind of trouble, Fan?

760
43:50.530 --> 43:51.380
A woman.

761
43:54.180 --> 43:54.740
Master.

762
43:55.310 --> 43:56.710
Please help him.

763
43:57.010 --> 43:58.380
You are so stubborn.

764
43:58.800 --> 44:00.160
You are so stubborn.

765
44:00.570 --> 44:01.130
Master.

766
44:01.580 --> 44:02.970
Fan is taking this past-life wealth

767
44:02.970 --> 44:04.740
to save someone.

768
44:08.130 --> 44:08.820
Master!

769
44:09.660 --> 44:10.370
Master!

770
44:11.180 --> 44:11.860
Master.

771
44:12.780 --> 44:13.530
Really.

772
44:13.900 --> 44:15.570
My parents gave birth to me but didn't raise me.

773
44:15.570 --> 44:16.340
Without this money,

774
44:16.340 --> 44:18.090
I can't even afford to get a wife.

775
44:18.090 --> 44:19.610
I hope you can help me.

776
44:21.700 --> 44:22.410
Master.

777
44:22.740 --> 44:23.300
Look,

778
44:23.700 --> 44:25.560
Fan is also a poor, suffering man.

779
44:25.820 --> 44:27.300
Please help him.

780
44:28.050 --> 44:28.900
Bring me his Four Pillars of Destiny.

781
44:28.900 --> 44:30.230
Let me take a look first.

782
44:31.380 --> 44:33.040
Your Four Pillars of Destiny.

783
44:36.450 --> 44:37.260
Master.

784
44:43.090 --> 44:44.620
Boundless Heavenly Honor!

785
45:00.070 --> 45:01.800
You are no ordinary person.

786
45:02.180 --> 45:04.980
You have the most past-life wealth I've ever seen.

787
45:05.260 --> 45:06.050
Come.

788
45:06.280 --> 45:07.280
Follow me.

789
45:14.530 --> 45:15.130
Please.

790
45:23.130 --> 45:24.340
See it for yourself.

791
45:52.600 --> 45:55.280
These are from our ancestors?

792
45:55.530 --> 45:58.930
That's your past-life wealth in there.

793
46:00.300 --> 46:01.900
Then how do I withdraw it?

794
46:04.710 --> 46:06.980
[In the next episode]

795
46:06.820 --> 46:07.930
I didn't expect

796
46:07.930 --> 46:11.450
to come up against you, Yuehaitang Branch's grandmaster, today.

797
46:11.450 --> 46:12.490
Master Mei,

798
46:12.490 --> 46:13.820
you've treated me like this—

799
46:13.820 --> 46:15.450
do you think the Tianxiang Sect

800
46:15.450 --> 46:16.660
will let you off?

801
46:16.660 --> 46:19.490
Does your Sect Master know his right-hand woman

802
46:19.660 --> 46:21.180
is planning an uprising?

803
46:21.570 --> 46:23.100
Why did you kill Mei Xuanzi?

804
46:23.410 --> 46:24.930
I can tell you the truth.

805
46:25.010 --> 46:26.530
But do you dare hear it?

806
46:26.710 --> 46:27.670
I dare.
